 give an italic run its own mask instead of sharing the upright one. An emphasis span styles every word below it, so nested spans and links inside emphasis pick it up, and copying italic text as HTML gives <em>.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"Actual-Chat/actual-chat","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:15:24Z","branch":"dev","commit_sha":"24f3c3a3385f8e1603a34a1e03e080fa3e8b2c5e","github_link":"https://github.com/Actual-Chat/actual-chat/commit/24f3c3a3385f8e1603a34a1e03e080fa3e8b2c5e","commit_subject":"fix(l10n): keep the detected UI language on a first visit","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"hoprnet/hoprnet","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:15:11Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"7d02e753763cbf0bacd89a84e735f8f4233713a4","github_link":"https://github.com/hoprnet/hoprnet/commit/7d02e753763cbf0bacd89a84e735f8f4233713a4","commit_subject":"feat(transport): surface return-path relayer-diversity blind spots (master) (#8464)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"jitsucom/jitsu","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:15:04Z","branch":"newjitsu","commit_sha":"7ab4a1c8c0583b52087060c0bf8a71d9af05fd3c","github_link":"https://github.com/jitsucom/jitsu/commit/7ab4a1c8c0583b52087060c0bf8a71d9af05fd3c","commit_subject":"fix(sync-sidecar): retry Postgres operations instead of panicking (JITSU-233) (#1527)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"mRemoteNG/mRemoteNG","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:14:31Z","branch":"v1.78.2-dev","commit_sha":"cf0c662505a4fcb94a40cfdb12ada340b16173bf","github_link":"https://github.com/mRemoteNG/mRemoteNG/commit/cf0c662505a4fcb94a40cfdb12ada340b16173bf","commit_subject":"Initial plan","ai_tool":"Copilot"},{"repo_name":"GMOD/jbrowse-components","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T14:14:30Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"15ce22d6e434662a058bd73dfa3df949f831c43c","github_link":"https://github.com/GMOD/jbrowse-components/commit/15ce22d6e434662a058bd73dfa3df949f831c43c","commit_subject":"Hic and CRAM adapters forward the cancellation signal into the header and contact